%% Diagram 8
graph TB
    subgraph "Client SDK"
        SDK[Feature Flag SDK]
        Cache[Local Cache]
    end

    subgraph "Server"
        API[Evaluation API]
        FlagStore[Flag Store]
        PersonStore[Person Store]
        Evaluator[Evaluation Engine]
        SSE[SSE Broadcaster]
    end

    subgraph "Evaluation Logic"
        CheckEnabled[Check Enabled]
        CheckWhitelist[Check Whitelist]
        CheckRollout[Check Rollout %]
        CheckRules[Check Rules]
        CheckAttributes[Check Attributes]
    end

    SDK -->|1. Evaluate| API
    API -->|2. Fetch Flag| FlagStore
    API -->|3. Fetch Person| PersonStore

    FlagStore --> Evaluator
    PersonStore --> Evaluator

    Evaluator --> CheckEnabled
    CheckEnabled -->|disabled| Result[Return: false]
    CheckEnabled -->|enabled| CheckWhitelist

    CheckWhitelist -->|in whitelist| ResultEnabled[Return: true]
    CheckWhitelist -->|not in whitelist| CheckRollout

    CheckRollout -->|within %| ResultEnabled
    CheckRollout -->|outside %| CheckRules

    CheckRules -->|no rules| ResultDisabled[Return: false]
    CheckRules -->|has rules| CheckAttributes

    CheckAttributes -->|match| ResultEnabled
    CheckAttributes -->|no match| ResultDisabled

    FlagStore -.->|Flag Update| SSE
    SSE -->|Push Update| Cache

    API -->|Return Result| SDK
    SDK -->|Update Cache| Cache

    classDef client fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef server fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef logic fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#4a148c,stroke-width:2px

    class SDK,Cache client
    class API,FlagStore,PersonStore,SSE server
    class Evaluator,CheckEnabled,CheckWhitelist,CheckRollout,CheckRules,CheckAttributes logic

