    PathValidator --> WorkspaceRoot

    PathValidator -->|Valid| FileSystem
    PathValidator -->|Invalid| Error[Return Error]

    Bash --> TimeoutManager
    TimeoutManager --> Shell

    EditFile --> FileSystem
    ReadFile --> FileSystem
    ListFiles --> FileSystem
    Git --> GitRepo

    FileSystem -->|Result| ToolRegistry
    Shell -->|Result| ToolRegistry
    GitRepo -->|Result| ToolRegistry
    Error --> ToolRegistry

    ToolRegistry -->|Tool Results| StateMachine

