%% Diagram 11
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Creating: POST /weavers

    Creating --> Pending: K8s Pod submitted
    Creating --> [*]: Creation failed

    Pending --> Running: Pod ready
    Pending --> Failed: Image pull failed
    Pending --> [*]: Timeout

    Running --> Running: Container active
    Running --> Succeeded: Exit code 0
    Running --> Failed: Exit code != 0
    Running --> [*]: TTL expired

    Succeeded --> [*]: Cleanup
    Failed --> [*]: Cleanup

    note right of Creating
        Validate request
        Generate weaver ID
        Create database record
        Submit to K8s
    end note

    note right of Pending
        Pull container image
        Inject secrets
        Start container
    end note

    note right of Running
        Accept client connections
        Execute commands
        Stream output
        Monitor health
    end note

    note right of Succeeded
        Mark as completed
        Cleanup K8s pod
        Update database
    end note

    note right of Failed
        Capture logs
        Mark as failed
        Cleanup K8s pod
        Update database
    end note

